// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Clue - TrainerClue 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Clue Name :
"P3341696317" "Trainers"
// DetailString :
"P416677389" "Trainers are capable of helping your character grow stronger. Whenever you gain enough experience to Level Up, a flashing arrow will appear near your Experience Bar. When you see this arrow, speak with a Trainer!<br><br>Depending on your character's level, Trainers can allow you to learn new Powers, or can help you add Enhancement Slots to Powers you already have.<br><br>Visiting Trainers every time you Level Up is an essential part of your character's growth - remember to train whenever you get the chance!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Clue - TravelClue 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Clue Name :
"P1623905109" "Ferries"
// DetailString :
"P974865901" "The Rogue Isles Ferry is the best method for Villains to move about the Rogue Isles. Each Ferry leads to every other City Zone that also has a Ferry. Note that some zones also have a Black Helicopter. Like the Ferry, the Black Helicopter is a good way to quickly reach any zone with its own Black Helicopter."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Clue - DayJobClue 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Clue Name :
"P1063790510" "Day Job Locations"
// DetailString :
"P2734387634" "Day Job Locations are places where you can receive bonuses based on the amount of time your character spends offline. If you log off in a Day Job Location, you will begin to accrue a Day Job Bonus associated with that location. Each Day Job Bonus only lasts a limited amount of time, based on how long your character was offline in the related Day Job Location.<br><br>Below are some example Day Jobs:<br><br><b>Hospital</b>: Grants an out-of-combat Regeneration bonus.<br><br><b>Arachnos Base</b>: Grants an Experience bonus for each completed mission.<br><br><b>Docks</b>: Grants a bonus Enhancement reward for each completed mission.<br><br><b>Black Market</b>: Grants a Temporary Power that allows you to teleport to the Black Market<br><br><b>Architect Entertainment</b>:  Grants bonus Architect Tickets for each completed Mission Architect mission."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// SouvenirClueDef - HeartsofDarknessActIClueSouvenirClue 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// SouvenirClueDef Name :
"P3887185674" "Remote Detonator"
// tDetailString :
"P4100067541" "This leftover detonator reminds you of your initial victories in Dr. Graves's game...<br><br><color Gold>The Hearts of Darkness - Rogues' Contest</color><br><br>It began with a summons from Dr. Graves, a grim surgeon with a short temper. He gathered you and four other Villains together and proposed a contest. The prize: unimaginable power and resources at the winner's disposal, courtesy of your unnamed benefactor.<br><br>You started by making sure that Arachnos took little notice of you. You played dumb for the Arbiters and got them fighting amongst themselves, and returned to Graves.<br><br>During the first round of the contest, you managed to trick Dollface out of finishing a race to the finish, and stole the win yourself. Graves, though displeased, was forced to concede the first victory to you.<br><br>For the second round, each contestant was required to formulate a plan of their own design, to display their villainous prowess. After investigating the others' plots, you came upon inspiration: you would destroy a Longbow base, lighting it up for all of Mercy to see!<br><br>As you engaged in your plan, a mysterious voice began to assist you. It directed you on the specifics of when and how to destroy the base.<br><br>As you were about to evacuate the base and let the explosives run their course, the voice revealed itself: Scirocco of Arachnos had assisted you! He directed you to continue participation in Graves's illicit contest, in the hopes of tracking down and capturing your unnamed benefactor."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task - Mission1 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog - DNAExtractor 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Page Intro Text :
"P3970689537" "<color orange>This looks like the registration console Dr. Graves told you to use when you showed up.  Large flashing words indicate that you should choose one of the buttons below the screen.</color><br><br><color red>Applicant will provide a biological sample to prove they are not in the employ of organizations such as Longbow.<br><br>Insert sample of bio-organic composition.</color>"
// Answer Text :
"P2110172073" "Insert blood sample"
// Answer Text :
"P89969420" "Insert hair sample"
// Answer Text :
"P1176599620" "Refuse to provide sample"
// Page BloodSample Text :
"P2685051743" "<color orange>Words begin streaming across the display.</color><br><br>...Analyzing...<br>...Analyzing...<br>...Analyzing...<br><br>Source material - Blood.<br><br>Spectral Analysis Readings - No traces of pathogens on record indicating Longbow alliegence.<br><br>Cellular Analysis - No traces of radical cellular mutation detected.<br><br>Blood Count Analysis - High fat composition in the sample suggests the source subject is prone to a poor diet and could possibly lose a few pounds."
// Answer Text :
"P426954141" "Hold on... Did this thing say I was FAT?"
// Page HairSample Text :
"P4251413910" "<color orange>Words begin streaming across the display.</color><br><br>...Analyzing...<br>...Analyzing...<br>...Analyzing...<br><br>Source material - Hair.<br><br>Spectral Analysis Readings - No trace of pollutants known to be found in Paragon City.<br><br>Texture Analysis - Sample shows chemicals found in low-quality haircare products.<br><br>Cellular Analysis - Abundance of dead epidermis clusters suggests sample source is afflicted by severe dandruff."
// Answer Text :
"P1169783404" "Hey!  I don't have dandruff!"
// Page NoSample Text :
"P959455609" "<color orange>Words begin streaming across the display.</color><br><br>All candidates must submit biological samples or face immediate termination.<br><br><color orange> A mechanical arm extends from the console.  At the end of the arm is what appears to be something that could only be described with one word - 'probe'.  Before you can react, the arm goes to work procuring a rather... painful... sample from your body.</color><br><br>Analyzing...<br><br>Matter Composition - No traces of known Longbow nutritional supplements detected."
// Answer Text :
"P1222236220" "YOU. WILL. PAY!!!!"
// Page AnalysisOne Text :
"P1951756736" "Genetic Analysis - Subject missing one strand of DNA within early strand sequence.  Anamoly recorded."
// Answer Text :
"P2611053399" "Wait... Did this just say I'm missing DNA???"
// Page AnalysisTwo Text :
"P1700188065" "Genemap Database Query Results - Subject matches no known genetic match from S.A.M. database.  INTERPOL records show two known matches.  Further inquiries prevented due to Triple Black Secret Clearance information lockdown."
// Answer Text :
"P571927166" "Two matches?  How... How is that even possible."
// Page AnalysisThree Text :
"P2749954910" "Psychological Profile - Subject shows signs of narcissim normally associated with sociopathic disorders.  Additional negative traits evidenced are the following - Delusions of Grandeur, Persecution Complex, Poor Impulse Control, and Exceptional Gullibility."
// Answer Text :
"P2382449702" "When have I ever been gulli - hold on... Uh oh."
// Page SelfDestruct Text :
"P1295586724" "Final Analysis - Subject has failed the first test.  Initiate self-destruct sequence."
// Answer Text :
"P3396131535" "[Quckly step away from the console!]"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog - DrGravesOne 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Page Intro Text :
"P2519632722" "Do not congratulate yourself too quickly.  That was but the first of many tests you will need to pass if you are to win the right to be our faceless master's protege."
// Answer Text :
"P2762420552" "What would have happened if I failed?"
// Page InformationPage1 Text :
"P132383318" "You would have made yourself useful in other ways.  For instance, I could likely find a use for any undamaged limbs that still remained.  However, there will be time to pursue that line of thinking later.  In the meantime, we will need to gather the rest of the candidates so that I may explain the rules to all of you."
// Answer Text :
"P3250342072" "Others?  Rules?  I want these answers now, Graves."
// Page InformationPage2 Text :
"P3923984894" "My, my... rather demanding, aren't we?  Allow me to point out that currently you are not in a position to make any demands.  Perhaps things may change in the future, but for now you will be following my instructions if you wish to be part of this trial.  Now follow me as we gather the rest.  I believe I saw Omnicore nearby."
// Answer Text :
"P1200436415" "I'll do as you say... For now."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog - OmnicoreOne 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Page Intro Text :
"P393897425" "You are to be one of my rivals?  You?  If you are an indicator of the type of the competition I am to expect, then it would seem this contest has ended before it even has begun."
// Answer Text :
"P258846561" "And you believe I view you as a threat?"
// Page InformationPage1 Text :
"P2996745249" "I couldn't care less what simple beliefs you hold, - what was it again - {HeroName}.  The fact remains that I am by far your superior on an intellectual level, and by the looks of you, on a physical level as well.  These indisputable facts are all that are important.<br><br>You may wish to spare yourself the humiliation of me besting you by just leaving - now."
// Answer Text :
"P3807064390" "So... You plan to beat me with pathetic, hollow threats?"
// Page InformationPage2 Text :
"P988361508" "You will see how pathetic my threats are when you're staring at your legs on the other side of the room and wondering where your torso went!  Care for a demonstration?!"
// Answer Text :
"P1320324544" "If it means you actually doing something, then sure!"
// Page InformationPage3 Text :
"P1933858106" "<color orange>Omnicore looks at Dr. Graves with what you believe to be glaring hatred from behind her mask.  A moment later she screams in frustration, then looks back to you.</color><br><br>I will not let someone like you ruin my chance at gaining unimaginable power.  We'll finish this at another time, {HeroName}."
// Answer Text :
"P2219357789" "I'm looking forward to it, Omnicore."
// Page InformationPage4 Text :
"P259583765" "<color orange>Omnicore jerks her head towards the direction of the newcomer, Zephyr.</color><br><br>And what exactly are you supposed to be?  You look like a lame excuse for a fog machine."
// Answer Text :
"P1426518044" "You should hear what I think *you* look like, Omnicore."
// Page InformationPage5 Text :
"P451295524" "WHAT!?  How dare you... Both of you.  I will no longer tolerate this from either of you!<br><br><color orange>Omnicore glares at Dr. Graves.</color><br><br>I may not be allowed to kill these miscreants, but I will not lower myself to speaking with them any longer."
// Answer Text :
"P1019784270" "It's about time you shut up, Omnicore."
// Page InformationPage6 Text :
"P2181865825" "<color orange>You turn and talk with with Zephyr."
// Answer Text :
"P3898145311" "Close"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog - ZephyrOne 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Page Intro Text :
"P1757367449" "I can't believe you let her talk to you that way and you just let her get away with it... just sayin'."
// Answer Text :
"P3769628913" "Who are you supposed to be?"
// Page InformationPage1 Text :
"P1498968228" "Me?  I'm Zephyr.  You know, like the wind."
// Answer Text :
"P1676266114" "You named yourself after the wind?"
// Page InformationPage2 Text :
"P1322042267" "No.  I <b>am</b> the wind.  You know, like the whole 'Fwoooooosh! Haha!  Crashed your ship into a shoal and now you're all gonna drown!  Boohoo... now cry your eyes out, you wuss."<br><br>That kinda wind, you know?<br><br>  And, man... I gotta say... that kinda thing never gets old, I'm telling you."
// Answer Text :
"P3005341616" "So you're telling me you're THE zephyr wind?"
// Page InformationPage3 Text :
"P2069735784" "Uh, yeah.  I thought I was pretty clear the first couple of times I said it, but hey, you know, whatever.  Oh, yeah, and I'm also the one who's gonna kick your butt in the competition, too."
// Answer Text :
"P2359697801" "Wait - why is the wind - you - competing for the prize?"
// Page InformationPage4 Text :
"P180209438" "Meh... I got nothing else better to do, you know? Ever since mankind got all technological-like, like that robo-freak, it's hard to cause all kinds of pain and sorrow and all that junk.  Stuff like making widows - or blowing down houses - or flipping up a gal's skirt.<br><br>Okay, well, I still do that one.<br><br>Anyways.  So, to get to the point, one day I turned myself into -"
// Answer Text :
"P1448836510" "I am no longer entertaining this conversation with you."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog - DollfaceOne 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Page Intro Text :
"P3049274457" "Oh! You... You're not going to hurt me, are you?"
// Answer Text :
"P1295164628" "That depends.  Are you Dollface?"
// Page InformationPage1 Text :
"P3504897099" "Who's Doll-<br><br><color orange>Dollface stops short as she is interrupted by Dr. Graves.</color><br><br>*hmph*<br><br>Yeah, I'm Dollface.  You're one of the other contestants, I'm guessing?"
// Answer Text :
"P1767176622" "Look, kid, this contest is for the grown-ups. Why don't you run along home."
// Page InformationPage2 Text :
"P479225940" "<color orange>Dollface glares at you.</color><br><br>Hey, pal, I'm older than I look, ok? Probably older than you, from the looks of it.<br><br>And who the heck are you anyway, turning your nose up at me, huh?"
// Answer Text :
"P3790519757" "I am known as {HeroName}."
// Page InformationPage3 Text :
"P2318093392" "Hmph. Yeah, I can see you calling yourself that.  So what makes you so special that you think you can beat someone like me?  Do you shoot frogs from your eyes or something?"
// Answer Text :
"P1248362428" "I have no desire to reveal my powers to you."
// Page InformationPage4 Text :
"P3264806681" "Okay, okay!  Calm down.  I was just asking because I wanted to know if I was going to get grossed out if I ever have to fight against you.  First of all, it's not nice to hit a girl.  But if you're going to start throwing puke at people or growing spikes from your body... well, I just don't want to see that kinda thing, okay?"
// Answer Text :
"P2234227566" "Then how do you expect to win?"
// Page InformationPage5 Text :
"P3494678372" "Oh, that's easy!  I'm going to convince everyone that I'm the best for the job.  I'm very talented at what I do.  I wouldn't say I'm the best at what I do, but I'm pretty darn good at it.  And if that doesn't work, then maybe I'll just stab you guys in the neck or something.<br><br>...tee hee...<br><br>I'm just kidding.  But you got real scared, didn't you?  Didn't they, Mr. Doctor?  They got so scared they were going to run away!<br><br>Just like how you're so scared you're going to run away right now.<br><br>Like now."
// Answer Text :
"P4064278022" "I doubt the Doctor is going to listen to -"
// Page InformationPage6 Text :
"P454001035" "...tee hee...<br><br>He is so silly, and a very nice man.  And he listens really well, too.<br><br>Really well.<br><br>Don't worry, though, I don't know you guys well enough yet.  I don't know what you like to hear.  But maybe I will one day, you know?<br><br>And then we can have a real fun time playing together."
// Answer Text :
"P1084225871" "What did you just do to him?"
// Page InformationPage7 Text :
"P771929566" "What?  Little old me, do something?<br><br>...tee hee...<br><br>All I did was suggest to him that he had a better place to be.  And I guess I was right, huh?  It's a coincidence, you know?"
// Answer Text :
"P4206621074" "Sure it was. A coincidence..."
// Page InformationPage8 Text :
"P4212490955" "Dr. Graves said there was another person, too?  Maybe we should go find them.  What was it, Cross-slice or something like that?<br><br><color orange>Dollface looks right into your eyes.</color><br><br>I think it would be fun if we all went and looked for that guy, don't you agree?"
// Answer Text :
"P102248407" "Yeah... I think I would be... A lot of fun..."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog - CrosscutOne 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Page Intro Text :
"P451617501" "So... Any preference to the type of cut?  A rump-roast perhaps?  Or perhaps some ribs...?"
// Answer Text :
"P87329371" "You're... going to eat them?"
// Page InformationPage1 Text :
"P1620907356" "That would be a waste of such interesting textures, wouldn't you agree?  No no... I have something else in mind.<br><br><color orange>Crosscut stares at you with a gargoyle-like gaze for a moment.</color><br><br>Did you know you have very pretty eyes?"
// Answer Text :
"P936895933" "What?  What makes you say that?"
// Page InformationPage2 Text :
"P2125074207" "I was wondering...<br><br>I was wondering if I could have them..."
// Answer Text :
"P935441307" "Over my dead body."
// Page InformationPage3 Text :
"P3642334991" "Oh, you are so kind..."
// Answer Text :
"P3913182963" "Yeah, ok. We're done."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog - DrGravesTwo 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Page Intro Text :
"P706015899" "<color orange>Dr. Graves speaks to all of you.</color><br><br>Now that I have all of you assembled - save for Omincore - it is time for the proceedings to begin.  I am sure each of you have many questions -"
// Answer Text :
"P2781850440" "Yes, and it's time we get answers, Graves."
// Page InformationPage1 Text :
"P586670780" "Your impertinence has been noted, {HeroName}.<br><br>Now then. Each of you will be given a trial to test the strength of your powers.  More important will be how you use them and on whom.<br><br>Throughout these trials, your faceless benefactor shall be watching you - and judging you.  Once each of you have completed your test, we shall then move onto the true competition.<br><br>For now, concern yourself with only how you can show that you are superior to your rivals."
// Answer Text :
"P2298548376" "I can kill them all right now if you'd like.  Will that work?"
// Page InformationPage2 Text :
"P817684040" "No, {HeroName}, that will not work.  All of you are prevented from killing each other upon threat of immediate disqualification and proceeding termination.  I would suggest that you all abide by this rule.<br><br>Another important thing to note... The one hosting this contest - the very same person who will grant you untold power - does not wish to be identified until the winner has been chosen.  Thus, this tournament is unsanctioned by Arachnos.<br><br>If any of you speak of this to anyone, you will not only be discredited, but will forever be known as a 'snitch'.  This, my friends, can in itself be a fate worse than death here within the Rogue Isles.<br><br>You will await further instructions as the trials are being prepared.  Now go."
// Answer Text :
"P3206717132" "I'll see you soon, Graves."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// IntroString :
"P2628520652" "You would believe me to be a ghoul?  And I assume your self-image is that of the misunderstood protagonist, is it?  Or maybe the snarling monster with a secret heart of gold?  Or perhaps someone cursed to a life they didn't want?<br><br>Bah.  I am not here to trade barbs with someone of your like.  However, what I am going to do is offer you, {HeroName}, a formal invitation to a very exclusive, albeit unsanctioned... competition.<br><br>Before you dismiss this opportunity, know this - the victor of the trial shall be granted the privelege of being apprenticed, if you will, to a person with very important connections.<br><br><color orange>Dr. Graves looks around at nearby Arachnos guards in a rather dramatic fashion before fixing his soulless eyes upon you.</color><br><br>Very, very important... connections."
// AcceptString :
"P3872970571" "I'm listening, Graves.  What do I need to do to make this happen?"
// SendOffString :
"P2483138175" "I'm glad to see that your ambition overshadows your attitude, {HeroName}.  You'll need both if you expect to surpass the others in the eyes of the one who is truly watching.  With that said, let us tarry no longer with this conversation.  Actions speak louder than words, and if you try hard enough, sometimes louder than screams.  I will give you the location you are to 'register' at.  Use the registration console within the gathering place to prove your intent and I shall then speak to you further."
// ActiveTaskString :
"P4288021714" "Register for Dr. Graves's tournament"
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P671624660" "I do not have time to waste catering to your personal schedule.  You are to meet me at the provided location... or forfeit your chance at gaining an enviable position of power.  Now go!"
// TaskTitle :
"P1752257348" "<color deepskyblue>The Hearts of Darkness - Rogues' Contest</color>"
// TaskSubTitle :
"P568965930" "<color deepskyblue>Healthy Competition</color>"

