// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P1254607233" "To say that I am infuriated by the manner in which you stole the victory out from under the clear winner is... well, we'll just say that's an understatement.<br><br>I was so looking forward to the look on your face when I told you that you had been disqualified.<br><br>...<br><br>However, it would seem our benefactor has deemed your actions within bounds of the contest.  Therefore, as much as it pains me to say - you have officially won the first round, {HeroName}."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task - Mission4 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog - CrosscutPatrol 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Page Intro Text :
"P1961857476" "Ahhh... my pleasantly plump friend.<br><br>Do you know how happy I am to see you here?<br><br>You being so very alone.<br><br>And with that beautiful, lost look in your eyes."
// Answer Text :
"P2490339655" "Don't even think of it, Crosscut."
// Page DialogOne Text :
"P1001124638" "Oh, I hate to disappoint you, but I already did.  I've been thinking about it all day.  I do so think about it all the time, to be precise.<br><br><color orange>Crosscut gazes at you from behind his mask.</color><br><br>Can you see the smile it gives me?  It's so, so big...<br><br>Why, it would take up your whole neck to make <b>you</b> smile that big, now wouldn't it?"
// Answer Text :
"P1405934906" "Try it and I'll --"
// Page DialogTwo Text :
"P2101902330" "You'll scream?  You were going to say scream, right?  Oh please please please tell me you said you would scream.<br><br>My last playthings here in the Hospital wouldn't scream for me and that made me so, so very sad.  If you would be so kind to put a smile on my face, {HeroName}, and I'll be very happy to do the same for you..."
// Answer Text :
"P1353770239" "Wait, you're attacking people here?  Here in the Hospital?"
// Page DialogThree Text :
"P2113090564" "Of course!  Where else can you find a place where your broken toys are fixed over and over?  You can make a cut, and another, and another and another and another and another... until all of those little tendons finally snap.<br><br>And then -- 'tada'!  All back together, right as rain as my dear old mother would say.<br><br>Maybe if I take enough pictures for my photo album, our patron will smile, too!"
// Answer Text :
"P842234845" "You're planning on brutalizing hospital patients to win this round?"
// Page DialogFour Text :
"P1712721474" "Oh... there is that, too, now that you mention it..."
// Answer Text :
"P1219917991" "...Alright then. I'll leave you to your... games."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog - DollfacePatrol 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Page Intro Text :
"P1097204313" "Oh!  It's the bad person who LIED and stole my win!!!  You know, just for that I should tell these nice Arachnos people that you kick puppies.<br><br>And old ladies crossing the street.<br><br>How would you feel if <b>I</b> lied like that, huh?"
// Answer Text :
"P2845578966" "You shouldn't be so gullible, Dollface."
// Page DialogOne Text :
"P2830957172" "OH YEAH!?  Well... Well, maybe <b>YOU'RE</b> the one who's gullible.  Ever think about that?!<br><br>Yeah, I didn't think so!"
// Answer Text :
"P2248108116" "Dollface, you're just being juvenile now.  Accept your defeat already."
// Page DialogTwo Text :
"P2054656768" "Juvenile?  I don't even know what that word MEANS!  You think you can outsmart me with your big, fancy vocabulary, huh?  That's it!  I'm changing my plan now.<br><br>I <b>WAS<b> going to walk up to these administrators and tell them it would be a good idea to give me my very own Arachnos Flyer. But you know what?  Now I'm going to... um...<br><br>I'm going to... uh...<br><br>Oh, I know... I'm going to tell them you tried to... to STEAL my purse! Yeah!  And then you're going to be in biiiiiig trouble!"
// Answer Text :
"P2684539549" "Is that so?  You know what they'll say if you tell them that, right?"
// Page DialogThree Text :
"P2230865394" "Yes, I know <b>EXACTLY</b> what they'll say.  They'll say, 'Miss Dollface, we'll send a whole army of cops and find that {HeroName}!'.<br><br> Uh... Then they'll give me a reward for bringing a mugger to justice.  And there will be a... uh... parade, right?  For me?"
// Answer Text :
"P1439352942" "No.  They'll throw you in the ocean for not defending yourself.  Only the strong survive here."
// Page DialogFour Text :
"P937440129" "<color orange>Dollface looks at you in horror.</color><br><br>Oh no... Really? Oh, that's terrible!  I don't like swimming, what with all of those slimy fishies taking baths in the ocean...<br><br>Fine... Then I'll let you win.  But I'm still going to fly a helicopter AND win this time around.  And - you - can't - stop - me!"
// Answer Text :
"P2061631949" "You go knock yourself out with that."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog - ZephyrPatrol 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Page Intro Text :
"P131456152" "Oh hey.  What's up, {HeroName}.  Nice moves back there in the trial.  You so stole that win!  Even though you totally punked me, it's all good.  I can appreciate a cool move."
// Answer Text :
"P2169577693" "Well, good to know you're not planning revenge."
// Page DialogTwo Text :
"P2166686283" "Naw, not really. I'm still gonna win, but I got no beef with you. Plus it's getting really boring standing around here waiting for these guys to set sail.  I'm talking the big one.  All those tiny commuter ferries ain't gonna do it for me."
// Answer Text :
"P1430303251" "Do what for you?"
// Page DialogThree Text :
"P2373560242" "Sinking them.  If you've only got a couple dudes on board, what's the point, you know? A good sinking needs to have, like, a TON of dudes for it to be fun and all.<br><br>Now that I think about it, I'm thinking I'll blow these dudes all the way to the north pole and get 'em all stuck in the ice!  I think I'll do it by sucking in alot of --"
// Answer Text :
"P775903541" "I don't want to hear what you're next going to say."
// Page DialogFour Text :
"P4153030824" "Whoahhh... Chill.  I don't know where you think I was going with that, but it was probably a lot more exciting than what I was going to say.  So look, are you gonna work on your master plan for the contest or something?<br><br>I mean, it's all super cool hanging out with you, you know, getting to know you and all -- <br><br>wait --<br><br>Sorry, what I meant to say was that you're, like, super boring and are totally harshing on my groove.<br><br>Plus you're scaring away the ladies."
// Answer Text :
"P489254309" "I'll be happy to leave you alone."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog - OmnicorePatrol 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Page Intro Text :
"P327228303" "Why are you bothering me, {HeroName}?  Are you here to interfere with my plan the way you stole the first round away from Dollface?"
// Answer Text :
"P3701403690" "No, I'm not worried about you winning."
// Page DialogOne Text :
"P3154192812" "Well then you are an overconfident fool!  I should be the highest on your list of concerns.  When I am done with my master plan, it will be quite obvious to everyone that only <b>I</b> deserve to rule by the side of our hidden patron!"
// Answer Text :
"P416585529" "You think your silly plan will work?"
// Page DialogTwo Text :
"P3446623969" "Only the fool laughs in the face of defeat, {HeroName}.  You don't even know my plan, yet you already feel you have won.  You may have won the first round through deceit, but I will win the next round through superior intellect and careful planning!"
// Answer Text :
"P1747020887" "And skulking around in an alleyway like common trash, right?"
// Page DialogThree Text :
"P3356227991" "I will not SUFFER YOUR INSULTS, {HeroName}.  I am neither skulking nor am I associating with the vermin that crawls within these walls.  I am waiting for the perfect moment to strike at these smugglers of contraband.  Contraband that will fetch a very high value once I seize it from their grubby hands!<br><br>And when I have won the contest, I will allow you to come begging on hand and knee for the scraps that are beneath my notice.<br><br>And I will deny you even that!"
// Answer Text :
"P1777451810" "You're seriously planning on attacking the entire Black Market?"
// Page DialogFour Text :
"P656040920" "No, {HeroName}.  I have already begun doing so even before you swaggered up to me.  What I am doing now is waiting for my homing devices to show me the whereabouts of their wealthiest distributors and hold them for ransom.  Once done... I shall <b>BUY</b> the Black Market's inventory and then sell it for a price that pleases me.<br><br>You do not possess the technological superiority to pull off a plan such as I have, {HeroName}.  You should spend time within Aeon's foolish video game he calls Architect Entertainment.  Maybe in a hundred years, you might come up with something one-tenth as cunning as I have.<br><br>Who am I kidding?  You'll be in one of Longbow's holding cells within days of me defeating you in this contest.<br><br>Believe me... I'll see that it happens."
// Answer Text :
"P2086685343" "Sound and fury, Omnicore. We'll see if you can back it up."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// IntroString :
"P4039708418" "You are blessed with a luck like no other, you know that {HeroName}?  Were it not for the intervention of our faceless benefactor, I would have disqualified you for the manner in which you stole your victory.  However, since it was deemed alright by the one patronizing these proceedings, I must award you the winner's spot in the first round.<br><br>That may not be to your liking, as you shall soon see.  Let us now move to the next trial, shall we?"
// AcceptString :
"P1790305383" "I can win with my hands tied behind my back.  Bring it, Graves."
// SendOffString :
"P1512920508" "How fitting you say that, for that is almost precisely what you will be experiencing.  You see, being the winner in the first round puts you in a rather undesirable postion.  The next round of the contest will require you pull off an act of mayhem and discord by your own design.  The loser of the last round has been given the opportunity to stake claim to a location where they will perform their deed... first.<br><br>You, being the winner, will get to pick last. <br><br>However, I am giving you this list of where the others have chosen to undertake thier plans, which our benefactor has provided as your 'prize' for winning the first round.  Perhaps you can glean some insight from them that will help your own plan to outdo theirs.  Now go."
// TaskSubTitle :
"P3101227869" "<color deepskyblue>Villain Without a Plan</color>"

