// ActiveTaskString :
"P1365419641" "Go to the AE Building and try to formulate a plan."
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P3363127947" "It would seem the last option for you is the AE building.  What a poor choice, indeed."
// VolumeDescription :
"P1003199778" "Travel to the AE Building"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - TaskSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P826203770" "You scan the Architect building for inspiration, but find the possibilities to be lacking.  However, Omnicore has given you have a much better idea...  You're going straight for Longbow -- In their own base!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P3082654722" "Now that you've staked out the AE building, it is time to put together your plan. I would expect --<br><br>What is that?  A Longbow base?!  You must be stark raving mad to do something...<br><br>No, no... I mispoke.<br><br>That is a WONDERFUL idea."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task - Mission5 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog - RemoteTerminal 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Page Intro Text :
"P10620604" "<color orange>This terminal appears to control a number of circuitry pathways throughout the building.  With a little coaxing, you can reroute the power to your bombs.  With enough of a delay accounted for, you should have enough time to set the bombs to explode and still get out of the building.</color>"
// Answer Text :
"P2122261471" "Hack the Terminal."
// Page ConvoNode1 Text :
"P1892494689" "<color orange>As you finish hacking the terminal, you hear footsteps approaching..."
// Answer Text :
"P1827437402" "Look behind you..."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog - SciroccoOne 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Page Intro Text :
"P730452095" "You have done well, {HeroName}. Even with my assistance, assaulting a Longbow base is no small task."
// Answer Text :
"P4194048505" "Scirocco?  You're the person behind all of this?"
// Page ConvoNode1 Text :
"P1348030447" "I am not. Your benefactor's identity remains a mystery to us both. However, do note that despite your pains to the contrary, Arachnos has taken notice of this contest.<br><br>Lord Recluse does not allow anything to happen within his city unless he has given his allowance for it to proceed. You and yours are in direct defiance of his wishes."
// Answer Text :
"P840585200" "So you gave me the explosives - to blow up myself?"
// Page SecondFloor Text :
"P2496399011" "Do not presume that I think as you do, {HeroName}. I am not so low as to defeat you through subterfuge. If I wished you dead, I would stand before you, sword in hand.<br><br>No, I set you up for success so that you may win this contest that you are taking part in.  And as you continue to win, you will provide me with the information I seek."
// Answer Text :
"P2079424178" "What is it you are looking for?"
// Page ThirdFloor Text :
"P246411746" "Your curiousity surpasses your station, {HeroName}.  I do not wish to divulge my motives at this time, and it is not necessary that I do so.  All you need to know at this point is that you are to continue your role in this game, all the while attempting to unveil the mask of the one truly behind it.<br><br>Of course, you can always decline. If you do, I believe your chances of escaping from this base alive would drop... <i><b>considerably</i></b>."
// Answer Text :
"P3661415449" "I... see. Alright, Scirocco. I'm in."
// Page LockDown Text :
"P371234390" "Arachnos appreciates your cooperation.  Now go back to your... coordinator... and instruct him to look at the smoke on the horizon.  Word will be spread that you were solely responsible for this.  You will be contacted in the future with further instructions.<br><br>And remember, {HeroName}... I am personally watching you."
// Answer Text :
"P2387926537" "I'll... I'll keep that in mind..."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// IntroString :
"P3364177035" "I will not be the one to stop you from getting yourself killed, {HeroName}.  If you wish to walk into a Longbow base without an army backing --<br><br><color orange>You hear a sharp ringing in your ears that drowns out all other sounds.  A calm voice rises above the cacophony, speaking to you:</color><br><br><color yellow>Wait until nightfall.  It will be arranged to leave only a skeleton crew on staff.  There will be explosives hidden away in a crate, waiting for you.  Use them to destroy the base.</color>"
// AcceptString :
"P793736867" "What explosives?  I'll do it, but where are the explosives?"
// SendOffString :
"P2737755598" "<color orange>The ringing subsides as quickly as it appeared.</color><br><br>--idea what explosives you're blabbering on about, {HeroName}.  It would seem as if you didn't fully work through your plan.  It will be a shame to no longer see your face in the competition, but I will say you very well may gain a great deal of respect from your fellow prisoners in the Zig.<br><br>Let us both see what your future holds, shall we?  The next round of your trial begins -<br><br>Now."
// ActiveTaskString :
"P679651391" "Blow up the Longbow Base!"
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P414899752" "Time is running out, {HeroName}.  If you are to carry out this foolish endeavor of a direct assault on a Longbow base, I would suggest you head there now.  Already one of your fellow candidates have completed their plan.  Try not to keep them waiting?"
// TaskSubTitle :
"P2726379072" "<color deepskyblue>Longbow Goes Boom</color>"

