// Dialog :
"P2882972455" "You pulled off your plan, and wound up working for another side in this contest."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P3942759852" "I do not know how on Earth you were able to do what you did, {HeroName}.  Were it not for numerous eyewitness reports of you being the one to escape from the base moments before it blew, I would suspect you of trickery.<br><br>It would seem... It would seem you have won this round, as well.<br><br>Do <b>NOT</b> look so smug, {HeroName}.  The next set of trials will not be so easy."

